# Google Maps API key — the ONLY place you set it. Used by the web/JS SDK, read
# by the Android build (android/app/build.gradle reads this file into the
# manifest), and used as the "show the map" switch. iOS uses Apple Maps and
# needs no key. Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and fill it in.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
